# ── Credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# review-secrets/ holds the non-production credential set copied into review
# worktrees. The values are deliberately non-functional (dummy exchange keys,
# mail pointed at an unroutable host, DATABASE_URL aimed at the test database),
# but they are still generated per-deployment and there is no reason to publish
# them. Regenerate on a new box; see the README.
review-secrets/
.env
.env.*

# ── Runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-project verdicts, the append-only review history, and the model-usage
# ledger. All deployment-specific and all regenerated by running.
state.json
state.json.bak-*
history.jsonl
usage.jsonl

# ── Working directories ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ephemeral git worktrees created per review, with node_modules bind-mounted
# from the live checkout and read-only large fixtures mounted in.
worktrees/

# ── Vendored binary ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/gitleaks

node_modules/
*.log
*.bak
*.bak-*
